This MIT licence applies to the SOURCE CODE only. Generated data artifacts in
this repository are analysis outputs derived from each bike share system's
published open data and remain governed by the source licences:

- BIXI Montreal trip data: BIXI Montreal open data terms (attribution to BIXI
  Montreal; https://bixi.com/en/open-data).
- Bike Share Toronto ridership data: Open Government Licence, Toronto
  (https://open.toronto.ca/open-data-license/).
- Weather-derived values: based on Environment and Climate Change Canada data.
- Any additional city sources carry the licence stated in their manifest entry.

Raw trip data is never committed to this repository.

